      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<div class=\"sbn-doc sbn-doc-marcador\"><p class=\"sbn-doc-titulo\">THE CITY&#39;S EYES</p>\n<table class=\"sbn-tabla sbn-doc-tabla sbn-marcador-tabla\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>0</th>\n<th>1</th>\n<th><strong>2</strong><br><em>start</em></th>\n<th><strong>3</strong><br>👁</th>\n<th>4</th>\n<th><strong>5</strong><br>☎</th>\n<th>6</th>\n<th><strong>7</strong><br>🔍</th>\n<th>8</th>\n<th><strong>9</strong><br>🚨</th>\n<th><strong>10</strong><br>🔥</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n</table>\n<p>👁 <strong>3</strong> · Someone is watching the journalist.</p>\n<p>☎ <strong>5</strong> · Someone calls the journalist.</p>\n<p>🔍 <strong>7</strong> · Someone pulls the thread on one of ours.</p>\n<p>🚨 <strong>9</strong> · Someone knocks at the door.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong>10</strong> · There is no door anymore.</p>\n</div>"
      },
