      "_key": "!journal.pages!b13NIR35K7HpthZv.4q0rKmYzfI8ZJ2zF",
      "name": "For the Storyteller",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<div class=\"sbn-para-narrador\"><p><strong>Format:</strong> Cut-out tracker. <strong>Distribution:</strong> Storyteller only (or in view, without the number).</p>\n<p><em>Storyteller: print it and use a paper clip or a token as a marker. In Foundry, a gauge on the scene or a token on a track. Players can see it; the exact number, better not.</em></p>\n</div>"
